  <button wx:if="{{season.hasData}}" class="{{season.canClaim ? 'secondary reward-secondary' : 'primary'}}" bindtap="openPoster">制作海报 ↗</button>
  <button wx:if="{{!season.reward}}" class="primary" data-tab="{{room.paired ? 'activities' : 'home'}}" bindtap="tab">{{room.paired ? '一起做件小事' : '先邀请另一半'}}</button>
  <view class="section-heading"><text>纪念章</text></view><view class="reward-levels"><view wx:for="{{rewardLevels}}" wx:key="min" class="reward-level {{season.points >= item.min ? 'unlocked' : ''}}"><view class="mini-medal"><image src="/assets/visual/medal.png"/><text>{{item.mark}}</text></view><view>{{item.name}}<text>一周累计 {{item.min}} 分</text></view><text>{{season.points >= item.min ? '已达成' : '待点亮'}}</text></view></view>
  <view class="flow-note">纪念章按已结束周的积分领取，不扣积分，无实物兑换。不上榜也可领取。</view>
  <button class="text-button" data-tab="rules" bindtap="tab">积分与周结算规则 →</button>
  <view wx:if="{{demo && showDemo}}" class="demo-season"><text>本机跨周验收</text><text>将演示时间推进至下周一，让刚完成的活动进入上周结算。不会影响真实时间或线上数据。</text><button class="secondary" data-action="nextWeek" bindtap="act" disabled="{{busy}}">演示进入下一周</button></view></block>
 </view>
 <view wx:if="{{tab === 'poster'}}" class="flow-page poster-page page-screen">
  <button class="flow-back" bindtap="returnSeason">‹ 奖章</button><view class="visual-heading"><text>分享这一周</text><image class="heading-art" src="/assets/visual/heart.png"/></view>
  <view class="poster-themes"><button class="{{posterTheme === 'lake' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-theme="lake" bindtap="posterTheme" disabled="{{posterBusy}}"><view class="theme-dot lake"></view>湖畔</button><button class="{{posterTheme === 'paper' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-theme="paper" bindtap="posterTheme" disabled="{{posterBusy}}"><view class="theme-dot paper"></view>晴天</button></view>
  <view class="poster-preview"><image wx:if="{{posterPath}}" src="{{posterPath}}" mode="widthFix" show-menu-by-longpress="{{true}}" bindtap="previewPoster" aria-label="本周纪念海报，点击预览"/><view wx:else class="poster-placeholder">{{posterBusy ? '正在把回忆写进海报…' : '海报尚未生成'}}</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{posterError}}" class="error">{{posterError}}<button class="text-button" bindtap="generatePoster">重新生成</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="albumSettings">检查相册权限</button></view>
  <button class="primary" bindtap="savePoster" disabled="{{posterBusy || !posterPath}}">{{posterBusy ? '正在生成…' : '保存到相册'}}</button><view class="poster-actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="previewPoster" disabled="{{!posterPath}}">预览图片</button><button class="secondary" open-type="share" disabled="{{!posterPath}}">分享小程序</button></view><view class="flow-note">海报不含地点与感想。“分享小程序”发送入口卡片。{{demo ? '本机演示海报带有演示标记。' : ''}}</view>
 </view>
 <view wx:if="{{tab === 'rules'}}" class="flow-page page-screen"><button class="flow-back" data-tab="board" bindtap="tab">‹ 榜单</button><view class="visual-heading"><text>积分规则</text><image class="heading-art" src="/assets/visual/trophy.png"/></view><view class="rule-points"><view wx:for="{{types}}" wx:key="id"><image src="/assets/visual/{{item.id}}.png"/><text>＋{{item.points}}</text><text>{{item.label}}</text></view></view><view class="rule-limit"><text>30</text>分 / 每日上限</view><view class="rule-step"><button class="disclosure" data-key="rule0" bindtap="uiToggle" aria-expanded="{{uiPanels.rule0 ? true : false}}"><text>双方完成</text><text>{{uiPanels.rule0 ? '−' : '＋'}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{uiPanels.rule0}}" class="help-copy">发起活动 → 另一半加入 → 达到时长 → 双方分别确认。等待加入期间不计时，单方确认不加分。</view></view><view class="rule-step"><button class="disclosure" data-key="rule1" bindtap="uiToggle" aria-expanded="{{uiPanels.rule1 ? true : false}}"><text>每日计分</text><text>{{uiPanels.rule1 ? '−' : '＋'}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{uiPanels.rule1}}" class="help-copy">散步和读书每次 8 分，自习和锻炼 10 分，电影和听歌 4 分。同类每天得分一次，每天最多 30 分。达到上限后仍保存回忆。</view></view><view class="rule-step"><button class="disclosure" data-key="rule2" bindtap="uiToggle" aria-expanded="{{uiPanels.rule2 ? true : false}}"><text>公开榜单</text><text>{{uiPanels.rule2 ? '−' : '＋'}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{uiPanels.rule2}}" class="help-copy">双方同意后匿名参与周榜，任一方可退出。按积分降序，同分并列；只展示前 100 对，边界同分可能无法全部展示。</view></view><view class="rule-step"><button class="disclosure" data-key="rule3" bindtap="uiToggle" aria-expanded="{{uiPanels.rule3 ? true : false}}"><text>每周结算</text><text>{{uiPanels.rule3 ? '−' : '＋'}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{uiPanels.rule3}}" class="help-copy">北京时间周一 00:00 切换周次，按活动完成时间归属周。周报保留积分、活动数量和各类得分；纪念章领取不重复发放。</view></view><view class="visual-notice">测试版 · 尚未验证定位与学籍</view><button class="primary" bindtap="openSeason">查看我的周结算 ↗</button></view>

 <view wx:if="{{demo && tab !== 'board'}}" class="demo-toggle" bindtap="toggleDemo">{{showDemo ? '收起演示工具' : '演示工具'}}<text>{{showDemo ? '−' : '+'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{demo && showDemo}}" class="demo-tools"><view>演示控制 · 当前身份：{{room.me === 'demo-a' ? '我' : '另一半'}}</view><view class="actions"><button wx:if="{{room.paired}}" class="text-button" data-action="switch" bindtap="act" disabled="{{busy}}">切换身份</button><button wx:if="{{room.active}}" class="text-button" data-action="advance" bindtap="act" disabled="{{busy}}">快进 30 分钟</button><button class="text-button" data-action="reset" bindtap="act" disabled="{{busy}}">重置演示</button></view></view>
 </block>
 <view wx:if="{{room && tab === 'activities' && room.active}}" class="activity-dock">
  <block wx:if="{{room.active}}"><view><text>{{room.active.name}}</text><text>{{room.active.startedAt === null ? '等待双方加入' : room.active.hasFinished ? '等待另一半确认' : room.active.remaining > 0 ? '约会进行中' : '可以确认完成'}}</text></view><button class="primary" data-action="{{room.active.canJoin ? 'joinActivity' : 'finish'}}" bindtap="act" disabled="{{busy || (!room.active.canJoin && (room.active.startedAt === null || room.active.remaining > 0 || room.active.hasFinished))}}">{{room.active.canJoin ? '我也加入' : room.active.hasFinished ? '已确认，等待 TA' : room.active.startedAt === null ? '等待 TA 加入' : room.active.remaining > 0 ? '还需 ' + room.active.remaining + ' 分钟' : '确认完成'}}</button></block>
  <block wx:else><view><text>{{selectedType.name}}</text><text>{{selectedType.minutes ? selectedType.minutes + ' 分钟 · ' : ''}}+{{selectedType.points}} 分</text></view><button wx:if="{{!room.paired}}" class="primary" data-tab="home" bindtap="tab">邀请另一半</button><button wx:else class="primary" bindtap="start" disabled="{{busy}}">发起约会 ↗</button></block>
 </view>
 <view class="bottom-nav"><view wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="id" class="{{tab === item.id || (item.id === 'activities' && tab === 'datePlan') || (item.id === 'home' && (tab === 'pair' || tab === 'journal' || tab === 'settings' || tab === 'trial' || tab === 'privacy' || tab === 'archives')) || (item.id === 'board' && (tab === 'couple' || tab === 'season' || tab === 'poster' || tab === 'rules')) ? 'current' : ''}}" data-tab="{{item.id}}" bindtap="tab" role="button" aria-label="{{item.label}}"><image class="nav-icon" src="{{item.id === 'timetable' ? '/assets/visual/calendar.png' : '/assets/icons/' + item.icon + (tab === item.id ? '-active' : '') + '.png'}}"/><text>{{item.id === 'activities' && room.active ? '约会中' : item.label}}</text></view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{editor}}" class="overlay"><view class="sheet"><view class="section-title">记录这一刻</view><textarea aria-label="共同感想" placeholder="今天一起经历了什么？" value="{{note}}" maxlength="300" data-field="note" bindinput="input"></textarea><view class="muted">{{note.length}} / 300 · 仅你们两人可见</view><button class="primary" bindtap="saveNote" disabled="{{busy}}">保存感想</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="close">返回</button></view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{uiRecord}}" class="overlay"><view class="sheet memory-detail"><image class="detail-illustration" src="/assets/visual/{{uiRecord.type}}.png"/><view class="section-title">{{uiRecord.name}}</view><text>{{uiRecord.date}} · ＋{{uiRecord.points}} 分</text><view wx:if="{{uiRecord.place}}" class="location">{{uiRecord.place}}</view><view class="note">{{uiRecord.note || '给这次约会留句话吧。'}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="uiEditRecord">{{uiRecord.note ? '编辑感想' : '写感想'}}</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="uiCloseRecord">关闭</button></view></view>
 <canvas wx:if="{{tab === 'poster'}}" type="2d" id="reward-canvas" class="export-canvas"></canvas>
 <view wx:if="{{completion}}" class="overlay"><view class="sheet completion-sheet"><image class="completion-art" src="/assets/visual/trophy.png"/><view class="reward-title">双人打卡成功</view><view class="completion-points">+{{completion.points}}<text>共同积分</text></view><view>{{completion.name}}</view><text class="muted">{{completion.reason}}</text><button class="primary" data-tab="activities" bindtap="tab">再约一次</button><button class="text-button" data-tab="board" bindtap="tab">看榜单</button><button class="secondary reward-secondary" data-tab="journal" bindtap="tab">写回忆</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="closeCompletion">继续浏览</button></view></view>
</view>
